    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/75c154bfae3e4ed1f4812b0315ef40f8.poster.avif?t=1718513247\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/75c154bfae3e4ed1f4812b0315ef40f8.webm?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/75c154bfae3e4ed1f4812b0315ef40f8.mp4?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confronting the Apocalypse</h2>&quot;Doom Survivors&quot; is an action Roguelike game where you become the last survivor, facing an endless army of doom. Control various deadly weapons, obliterate hordes of enemies, and engage in a life-and-death duel with ruthless evil leaders. You are the sole hope, the guardian of this collapsing world.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/587108fc2f082657ea5d477915cc0d5a.poster.avif?t=1718513247\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/587108fc2f082657ea5d477915cc0d5a.webm?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/587108fc2f082657ea5d477915cc0d5a.mp4?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Personalized Upgrades</h2>Each weapon in the game boasts a set of distinctive evolutionary branches, allowing you to infuse it with a sense of individuality. Embark on a journey of profound exploration, navigating through various branches to identify the evolution path that aligns best with your unique gaming style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/b9996db99039a4dcea0167762d7b3db0.poster.avif?t=1718513247\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/b9996db99039a4dcea0167762d7b3db0.webm?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/b9996db99039a4dcea0167762d7b3db0.mp4?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Perfect Combinations</h2>Each hero wields unique skills capable of tipping the scales in battle. By enhancing accessories and equipment, you'll unlock flawless combinations, continually evolving weapons beyond their limits, ensuring that power firmly rests in your hands. With intuitive controls that are easy to grasp, immerse yourself in the despair and hope of this apocalyptic world. Brace yourself, courageously embark on this journey into doom, and relish the thrilling excitement the game unfolds!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/75c154bfae3e4ed1f4812b0315ef40f8.poster.avif?t=1718513247\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/75c154bfae3e4ed1f4812b0315ef40f8.webm?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/75c154bfae3e4ed1f4812b0315ef40f8.mp4?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confronting the Apocalypse</h2>&quot;Doom Survivors&quot; is an action Roguelike game where you become the last survivor, facing an endless army of doom. Control various deadly weapons, obliterate hordes of enemies, and engage in a life-and-death duel with ruthless evil leaders. You are the sole hope, the guardian of this collapsing world.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/587108fc2f082657ea5d477915cc0d5a.poster.avif?t=1718513247\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/587108fc2f082657ea5d477915cc0d5a.webm?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/587108fc2f082657ea5d477915cc0d5a.mp4?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Personalized Upgrades</h2>Each weapon in the game boasts a set of distinctive evolutionary branches, allowing you to infuse it with a sense of individuality. Embark on a journey of profound exploration, navigating through various branches to identify the evolution path that aligns best with your unique gaming style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/b9996db99039a4dcea0167762d7b3db0.poster.avif?t=1718513247\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/b9996db99039a4dcea0167762d7b3db0.webm?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746830/extras/b9996db99039a4dcea0167762d7b3db0.mp4?t=1718513247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Perfect Combinations</h2>Each hero wields unique skills capable of tipping the scales in battle. By enhancing accessories and equipment, you'll unlock flawless combinations, continually evolving weapons beyond their limits, ensuring that power firmly rests in your hands. With intuitive controls that are easy to grasp, immerse yourself in the despair and hope of this apocalyptic world. Brace yourself, courageously embark on this journey into doom, and relish the thrilling excitement the game unfolds!<br><br>",
